    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63077" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίγδος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυεία</span>
			, <i>mortar</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				589
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				618
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				35
			</span></i>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴγδις</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>clay mould</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.189
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.Dion.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				249
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>lye</i>, used as soap, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1229.27
			</span></i>: so in <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίγδα:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀκόνη, καὶ ἡ κονία</span>.</div>
